From cff2c733c8cd4318f93130e35369b4cc15bb7b49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:03:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Boss teams: Johto-heavy rival and the post-game bosses

The rival's team is now all Johto: Sneasel, the Zubat line, the Mareep
line, Misdreavus, the Larvitar line and his starter, through every
battle including Mt. Moon and the Indigo Plateau.

New teams for the Kanto Gym Leaders, Blue, Red, the second Elite Four
round and all sixteen Gym Leader rematches.
